    "body": "fix on issue/3474-same-angle-arc · PR #3500 · pinned by same_angle_arcs::fanuc_and_linuxcnc_post_a_same_angle_arc_as_a_straight_move, same_angle_arcs::every_post_writes_a_same_angle_arc_as_its_straight_move, same_angle_arcs::arc_fate_reads_a_same_angle_short_arc_as_a_straight_move · merges when reviewed\n\nThe case is confirmed by a post on the #3471 head. No control ran it. Fanuc mm wrote `G01 X10.011 Y5.` and then `G03 X10.01 Y5. Z5.5 I-0.011 J0. F180`. The start and the end have the same angle about the centre. PR #3500 is stacked on #3471.\n",
